  npcName: Roman
  lines:
  - english: Have you noticed that some Spirimonz don't want to leave our hands,
      while others are more independent?
    french: "Tu as remarqu\xE9 que certains Spirimonz ne veulent pas quitter notre
      main et d'autres sont plus autonomes ?"
  - english: 'Personally, I like to sit my Spirimonz in rooms while I investigate
      elsewhere. '
    french: "Personnellement j'aime bien asseoir mes Spirimonz dans des pi\xE8ces
      pendant que j'enqu\xEAte ailleur. "
